Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-[Akari] {\i1}Taiyo.{\i0}\N-[Hide] {\i1}Taiyo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.93,0:00:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[Hikaru] {\i1}Big Bro.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Big Bro? Big Bro!\N-[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.68,0:00:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Big Bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.39,0:00:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You were having a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.98,0:00:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.23,0:00:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.82,0:00:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hikaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.91,0:00:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.49,0:00:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are Mom and Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.83,0:00:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two have been up for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.83,0:00:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I woke him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.17,0:00:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[Akari] Morning, Taiyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.63,0:00:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Breakfast is on the table already.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.55,0:00:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like you to oversleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.76,0:00:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[both laugh]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.34,0:00:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps softly, breath trembles]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.30,0:00:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Big Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.55,0:01:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get breakfast out of the way\Nso we can start playing again!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.48,0:01:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ opening theme song playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.91,0:01:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,MISSION: YOZAKURA FAMILY
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.03,0:02:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}MISSION 46: DREAMS
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.03,0:02:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.33,0:02:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ soft piano music playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a second.\NYou left food on your plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.37,0:02:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't eat right,\Nyou'll never get bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! Look at me.\NI'm having seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.63,0:02:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that why you have\Nthat big gut these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.09,0:02:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.17,0:03:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-You thought so too, Hikaru?\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.51,0:03:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaining weight in your middle age?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.51,0:03:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you too, honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.80,0:03:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I admit that lately...\NHey, you're not changing the subject!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.43,0:03:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hikaru. I'll help you with it,\Nso clean that plate of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps] Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.27,0:03:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[exclaims] Thanks, Taiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.99,0:03:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-[Akari] You didn't get any tea on you?\N-No, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.16,0:03:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How did I... just now...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.24,0:03:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know! Why don't we all\Ngo somewhere this weekend?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.79,0:03:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, good idea!\NWhere do you two want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.67,0:03:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Me! Me! I want to go camping!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Camping, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.75,0:03:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,\Nwe haven't done that lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was younger,\Nmy dream was to go on a solo campout,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.38,0:03:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,so I read tons of magazines\Nand bought all the gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.51,0:03:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But I ended up never using them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.77,0:03:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that something\Nyou'd like to do too, Taiyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.98,0:03:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.10,0:03:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything's fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.73,0:03:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Will that be okay with work, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.69,0:03:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! I took some time off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.15,0:04:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-[Hikaru] Wow! You rock!\N-[Hide] Attagirl! [laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.78,0:04:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[Akari] It's going to be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.91,0:04:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts softly]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[Hikaru yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Big Bro, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.59,0:04:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, we lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.46,0:04:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.51,0:04:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not yourself today, Big Bro.\NYou've been in a daze the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, okay? Let's do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.55,0:04:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, get your head in the game this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.06,0:04:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[Hikaru] The problem is\Nyou leave yourself too open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.48,0:04:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to look at the whole field.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this time,\Nwe're clearing it for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.90,0:04:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ pensive music playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[Taiyo] {\i1}What was it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.95,0:04:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It feels like...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.45,0:04:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've forgotten something important.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[all laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.21,0:04:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[Taiyo] {\i1}Well, whatever.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.88,0:05:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[inaudible]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.43,0:05:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[Taiyo gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.52,0:05:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ tense music playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.98,0:05:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Big Bro Shinzo! Kengo!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.44,0:05:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To the ship?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.61,0:05:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.30,0:05:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mutsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.95,0:06:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Kyoichiro! Big Sis Futaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.37,0:06:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Shinzo! Big Sis Shion!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.91,0:06:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kengo! Nanao!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[static crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.58,0:06:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All of them?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's Father's power?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ tense music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.77,0:06:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[Dennoudaimaou G over tablet]\N{\i1}Scan of the ship complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm picking up high levels of someinine{\i0}\N{\i1}spreading all over the ship like a bug.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If there's a simultaneous explosion,{\i0}\N{\i1}it won't take out just the ship.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.44,0:06:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All of the surrounding waters{\i0}\N{\i1}will be wiped out.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.70,0:06:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you been able to contact\Nthe Yozakuras?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The modules have been incinerated,{\i0}\N{\i1}so communication is a no-go.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:06:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to go rescue them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.95,0:06:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up, Ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.21,0:07:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't just go in blind\Nwithout knowing what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with the Chairman on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.72,0:07:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.97,0:07:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Giga, contact the Harbor Control Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.18,0:07:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask them to expand the blockade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.52,0:07:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[Dennoudaimaou G] {\i1}Roger that!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.44,0:07:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's leave the rest to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.36,0:07:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[Taiyo] {\i1}No matter what,{\i0}\N{\i1}the way things stand now,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.40,0:07:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the only one who can save the others...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.05,0:07:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mowing down the welcome party\Nthat I sent out for you, how savage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.84,0:07:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're starting to take after Kyoichiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.31,0:07:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be here momentarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.02,0:08:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ foreboding music playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.29,0:08:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Taiyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.83,0:08:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dinnertime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.88,0:08:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts angrily]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.01,0:08:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.56,0:08:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ somber music playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[Momo] My Blooming is "Dreams."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.28,0:08:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You had one yourself, didn't you?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.03,0:09:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}An ideal dream{\i0}\N{\i1}where pain and suffering do not exist.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything enveloped\Nin this cherry blossom scent
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.17,0:09:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,is my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't a soul who can resist it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.13,0:09:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,With the sole exception of you,\Nas you have Tsubomi's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.34,0:09:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[Taiyo grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.68,0:09:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn them all back to who they were!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.02,0:09:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[Momo] I did turn them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.77,0:09:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Into who my family should be, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.36,0:09:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You call this a family?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A family is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.70,0:09:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,ASANO FAMILY GRAVE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.03,0:09:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A family is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.66,0:09:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.\NThis is what family is, Taiyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.50,0:09:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.54,0:09:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[Momo] You should know yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Families are frail and ephemeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I decided\Nto create one from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.55,0:10:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A strong family\Nthat can never be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.65,0:10:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[thunder rumbles]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ contemplative music playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.79,0:10:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So I was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.79,0:10:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned Kawashita.\NHaving the gall to do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This boy belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.84,0:10:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.93,0:10:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[Taiyo] {\i1}It's not a dream.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I remember this.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.35,0:10:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I thought I was seeing things.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:10:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The paramedics can handle the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.99,0:10:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[Taiyo] {\i1}But that day, I'm sure that...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}someone was...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.66,0:11:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been watching over you all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Struggle as I might from within,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.71,0:11:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I couldn't break{\i0}\N{\i1}the Yozakura karmic cycle.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.63,0:11:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And so I needed fresh blood.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.22,0:11:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was a no-brainer, really.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.22,0:11:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No better fit for Mutsumi than a simple,{\i0}\N{\i1}unaffected neighborhood boy like you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.82,0:11:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm the one who chose you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.41,0:11:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't care{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.62,0:11:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}who I have to sacrifice{\i0}\N{\i1}if it's for all your sakes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:12:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who made you strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[breath trembling]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.22,0:12:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[Momo] True,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Profuse Blooming of 10,000 Flowers\Ncan resist my Blooming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.10,0:12:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that you're rattled\Nby your memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,you've left yourself open.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.07,0:12:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in the middle of a dream now
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.44,0:12:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,from which you'll never wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.07,0:12:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The ideal family that I envisioned
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,will be completed at last here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Taiyo, to the Yozakura family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.69,0:12:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,To hell with this illusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.44,0:13:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ sentimental music playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.65,0:13:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.74,0:13:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.32,0:13:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,that true bliss\Nwhere not a single person is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go ahead and relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not to blame for any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.17,0:13:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.13,0:13:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender yourself to the blissful dream\Nyou've been seeking all this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.13,0:13:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Taiyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.30,0:13:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotten so big, Taiyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.56,0:13:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ sentimental music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.03,0:13:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[Taiyo] {\i1}Mom.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to leave you all alone, Taiyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}MATRICULATION CEREMONY
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.56,0:14:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[Taiyo] {\i1}Dad.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.10,0:14:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've missed you, Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.45,0:14:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[inaudible]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.16,0:14:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[inaudible]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[Taiyo] {\i1}Hikaru.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.08,0:14:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.38,0:14:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk about my family\Nusing those fake images and fake voices!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.05,0:14:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can never see them again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.67,0:14:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can never talk to them again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.38,0:14:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't ever go back.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.01,0:14:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how many regrets I have,\Nit's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.43,0:14:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much I care,\Nit won't do any good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.93,0:15:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I prayed, I screamed, I raged, I cried...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.07,0:15:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and accepted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.65,0:15:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you should accept it one more time,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.78,0:15:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,the future that you were always\Nmeant to walk into.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, fiction will become reality,\Nand the lies will become the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.25,0:15:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[all chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.54,0:15:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And then see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[Hikaru chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.34,0:15:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.30,0:15:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bro! Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.97,0:15:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.06,0:15:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.81,0:15:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Nanao's merry-go-round\Nis totally awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.89,0:15:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now, Hikaru!\NNot looking straight ahead is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hikaru is so full of energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.69,0:15:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of my kids are boys,\Nso I can never relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.24,0:15:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm so glad to have
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.53,0:15:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,a girl like Mutsumi as Taiyo's bride!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.08,0:15:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:16:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so lively here now, so I'm happy too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.87,0:16:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Momo,\Nwhat do you say to a drink tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.92,0:16:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.25,0:16:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't I open\Nanother bottle of Yozakura Blizzard?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.09,0:16:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Taiyo! Hikaru! Get back here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.48,0:16:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[Taiyo] {\i1}No.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This isn't reality.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.44,0:16:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And yet...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.61,0:16:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Big Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.79,0:16:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[Taiyo] {\i1}Damn it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:17:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bro...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.31,0:17:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so like you to make\Nsuch a violent entrance, Kyoichiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.44,0:17:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, then, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.91,0:17:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.99,0:17:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ tense music playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.39,0:17:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Kyoichiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.98,0:17:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[Momo] Arachne - Goddess's Web...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.73,0:17:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The unassailable wall\Nthat seals off everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,a secret Steel Spider technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.53,0:17:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why the scent of cherry blossom\Nfailed to reach him
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.49,0:17:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and my Blooming didn't affect him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You perfected it at last,\NI see, Kyoichiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel nostalgic for the days that\Nwe spent coming up with it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.58,0:18:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A skill that we created\Nfor the family's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So this isn't the way\Nit was meant to be used.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.34,0:18:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.01,0:18:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kyoichiro] I'm going to protect my family\Nfrom every kind of evil and...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.52,0:18:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,from all that I'm about to do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.27,0:18:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[Momo] Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful, Kyoichiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.07,0:18:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's true that I can't destroy{\i0}\N{\i1}Arachne - Goddess's Web.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.11,0:18:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.70,0:18:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm the one who taught you{\i0}\N{\i1}how to use those threads.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.66,0:18:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your thread technique is your very soul.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your weaving method{\i0}\N{\i1}shows your love for your family.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:18:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I may not be able to break it,{\i0}\N{\i1}but I can unravel it,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.38,0:18:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}just as I can your soul.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.43,0:19:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your rage and hatred towards me,{\i0}\N{\i1}you no longer need such memories.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.39,0:19:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No more thinking that you have to kill me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.85,0:19:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because starting now,{\i0}\N{\i1}you're going to love me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.83,0:19:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts softly]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.34,0:19:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ sentimental music playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.39,0:19:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hard at work bright and early!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.39,0:19:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.35,0:19:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take me on for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.28,0:20:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reflexes aren't bad,\Nbut they are too straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.82,0:20:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to deflect multiple attacks\Nwith a single thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.87,0:20:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Overwhelm the enemy\Nwith defensive maneuvers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.54,0:20:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Do that, and you can create time\Nto launch an attack on the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.05,0:20:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my boy! Such a quick learner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.60,0:20:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.77,0:20:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.73,0:20:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,These are Steel Spider gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.90,0:20:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They suit you more than guns or knives,\Ndon't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, we have matching pairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.11,0:20:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.19,0:20:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[Momo] {\i1}You've been practicing{\i0}\N{\i1}with your bare hands until now,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.61,0:20:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so you've felt{\i0}\N{\i1}every minute movement of those threads.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.20,0:20:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And because of that, your threads{\i0}\N{\i1}have been honed even sharper.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.83,0:20:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So the next step is to understand{\i0}\N{\i1}the true nature of that power.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:20:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you want to use this power?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.59,0:21:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to use this power\Nto protect everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.59,0:21:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Those threads sever your enemies\Nand envelop your allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.89,0:21:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Those gloves may be weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.93,0:21:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but they're also armor\Nthat will protect your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.27,0:21:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I poured my heart into weaving them\Nso that you wouldn't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Take good care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.73,0:21:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.32,0:21:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cherish them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts softly]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.91,0:21:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to go so far\Nas to brainwash me, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.88,0:21:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.67,0:21:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.76,0:21:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Both then and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.18,0:21:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I should have stopped you,\Nbut I couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.68,0:21:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.27,0:21:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I had high hopes\Nthat my family might come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.73,0:22:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even though I knew it would never happen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.73,0:22:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no different...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.11,0:22:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Than you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.91,0:22:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end this now... for our sakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.95,0:22:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ somber music playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.26,0:22:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.69,0:22:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ ending theme song playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.07,0:24:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,NEXT EPISODE\NMOMO AND REI

